<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-include path="./_theme.mjml" />
    <mj-title>Do you still use your league login?</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>It has not been used for a year. Keep it with one click, or let it go.</mj-preview>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#eef0f4" width="600px">

    <mj-include path="./_header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding="28px 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" text-transform="uppercase">Your login</mj-text>
        <mj-text mj-class="h1" padding="6px 24px 0">Do you still use it?</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section padding="16px 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          Hello<%= firstName ? ' ' + firstName : '' %>. Your login to the league website
          (<%= email %>) has not been used since <%= lastActive %>. We delete logins nobody
          uses, so that the list of people who can enter results and see contact details
          stays short.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text mj-class="callout">
          To keep it, press the button below, or simply log in, before <%= deadline %>.
          Logging in to the Tameside league&rsquo;s website counts too: it is the same login.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="<%= keepUrl %>" css-class="cta">Keep my login</mj-button>
        <mj-text mj-class="muted">
          If you do nothing, the login will be deleted after <%= deadline %>, from this site
          and from the Tameside league&rsquo;s. Your results stay where they are: they are the
          league&rsquo;s record, not part of your login. You can sign up again at any time.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="./_footer.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
